 * store/sebo-bbgatekeeper/bbgatekeeper/bbgatekeeper_logger.php.template — static gatekeeper logic.
 *
 * Copied (with a generated header prepended) into store/sebo-bbgatekeeper/bbgatekeeper/bbgatekeeper_logger.php
 * by core/deployer.php. Contains no site-specific values - those live in
 * store/sebo-bbgatekeeper/bbgatekeeper/bbgatekeeper_config.php, generated separately by core/config_exporter.php.
 *
 * Runs as auto_prepend_file on every request, BEFORE phpBB (or anything
 * else) bootstraps. Keep this file dependency-free and fast.
